### List tenant groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{tenantName}}/groups

### Create tenant group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{tenantName}}/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{groupName}}",
  "displayName": "{{groupDisplayName}}"
}

### Get tenant group
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/{{tenantName}}/groups/{{groupName}}

### Update tenant group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{tenantName}}/groups/{{groupName}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{groupName}}",
  "displayName": "{{groupDisplayName}}",
  "members": []
}

